#. module: sn_wsd_code_rule
#. from po: d:\odoo\odoo19wsd\addons\account\i18n\zh_CN.po
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:sn_wsd_code_rule.field_sn_code_counter__value
msgid "Value"
msgstr "值"

#. module: account
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account.field_account_reconcile_model_line__amount_string
msgid ""
"Value for the amount of the writeoff line\n"
"    * Percentage: Percentage of the balance, between 0 and 100.\n"
"    * Fixed: The fixed value of the writeoff. The amount will count as a debit if it is negative, as a credit if it is positive.\n"
"    * From Label: There is no need for regex delimiter, only the regex is needed. For instance if you want to extract the amount from\n"
"R:9672938 10/07 AX 9415126318 T:5L:NA BRT: 3358,07 C:\n"
"You could enter\n"
"BRT: ([\\d,]+)\n"
"    If the label is \"01870912 0009065 00115\" and you need the amount in decimal\n"
"    format (e.g. 90.65), you can use a regex with capturing groups, for example:\n"
"        \\s+0*(\\d+?)(\\d{2})(?=\\s)\n"
"    In this case:\n"
"    • the first group captures the integer part\n"
"    • the second group captures the decimal part (last two digits)\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"冲销行的金额取值方式\n"
"    * 百分比：余额的百分比，介于 0 到 100 之间。\n"
"    * 固定：冲销的固定值。金额为负数时计为借方，为正数时计为贷方。\n"
"    * 从标签：无需正则分隔符，只需要正则表达式本身。例如，如果您想从\n"
"R:9672938 10/07 AX 9415126318 T:5L:NA BRT: 3358,07 C:\n"
"中提取金额，可以输入\n"
"BRT: ([\\d,]+)\n"
"    如果标签为 \"01870912 0009065 00115\" 而您需要小数\n"
"    形式的金额（例如 90.65），可以使用带捕获组的正则表达式，例如：\n"
"        \\s+0*(\\d+?)(\\d{2})(?=\\s)\n"
